!
! Lines 49 and 54 are SYN cards: the "+" after the location marks a
! RESOLVED VALUE and not the location counter, and the printed
! "+00000000" with a data description beside it is the inherited
! description, not emitted storage.  Neither moves the counter, and
! neither takes a !CHECK -- their !SYM lines are the check.
! Line 50's "000000.00+" IS storage: a VF full word of zero.
!
! The asterisks on lines 4, 22 and 38 are the listing's own
! word-boundary marks and carry no bits.
!
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! CHECKS
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
!SYM   WLODE    216333.00
!SYM   WCONA    216337.40
!SYM   WJTST    216341.40
!SYM   WCON     216343.40
!SYM   WCONE    216351.00
!SYM   WCONV    216356.00
!SYM   WCONY    216371.00
!SYM   WPATT    215166.00
!SYM   WINTOR   216371.40
!SYM   WJERR    216372.00
!SYM   SINTO    216371.40
!CHECK 216333.00 | 000003.00 80 215230.00 A0 | line 5 W LODE TI,0,3.0,STLR -- printed byte reads "AC"; the row's own octal fields print 0 as the same open glyph, and there is no index on operand 2, so it is A0 (see GLYPHS 3)
!CHECK 216334.00 | 000023.00 80 215250.32 A0 | line 6 TI,13,19.0,STLR+16.0 -- same instruction, CLOSED 0 in that byte
!CHECK 216335.00 | 215231.47 A0 | line 7 BE,STLR+1.32(.26,2)111101 -- parenthetical entry, accepted as printed
!CHECK 216335.40 | 216336.07 C6 | line 8 BOPZ,$.32 -- "$.32" with no "+" is $ plus 32 bits; accepted as printed
!CHECK 216336.00 | 000021.37 70 | line 9 SR,15,$1
!CHECK 216336.40 | 000000.03 30 | line 10 SV,1,0.0
!CHECK 216337.00 | 216341.71 40 | line 11 BZXVZ,WJTST
!CHECK 216337.40 | 215163.03 01 | line 12 W CONA LVI,$1,SFPTE -- also p.114's witness for SFPTE's address
!CHECK 216340.00 | 216371.25 80 001000.36 F0 | line 13 CM1111(BU,1),WCONY.21 -- .21 is DECIMAL, printed .25 octal
!CHECK 216341.00 | 216344.50 00 | line 14 B,WCON+1.0
!CHECK 216341.40 | 215230.42 90 | line 15 W JTST KV,$1,SLOWER -- S LOWER is 215230.40, the .02 is KV's
!CHECK 216342.00 | 216372.32 42 | line 16 BXL,WJERR
!CHECK 216342.40 | 215230.02 90 | line 17 KV,$1,SUPPER
!CHECK 216343.00 | 216372.32 40 | line 18 BZXL,WJERR
